    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1433">

                <pb facs="1800" n="1600" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1600"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Potsdam/7–3045</note>
                <head>No. 1433<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Text Submitted by the Soviet
                        Delegation</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d1433-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1945-08-01T23:59:59+03:00"
                            notBefore="1945-07-30T00:00:00+03:00">Undated</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Draft Entry for the
                    Protocol</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Regarding the Black Sea
                        Straits</hi></p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>The three Governments have recognized the necessity of revising the
                        Straits Convention, concluded at Montreux,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d1433-f2"/>
                        as not conforming to present conditions.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>The three Governments will continue conversations with Turkey on this
                        question.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1433-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d1433-f1-content">
                <p>Submitted to the Protocol Subcommittee. It was discussed at the Eleventh Meeting
                    of the Foreign Ministers, August 1. See <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref
                        target="#pg551">p. 551</ref>. Cf. <ref target="#d1369">document No.
                        1369</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1433-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1433-f2-content">
                <p>Signed July 20, 1936. The substantive provisions are printed in Howard, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">The Problem of the Turkish Straits</hi>, p. 25. For full
                    text, see League of Nations Treaty Series, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >clxxiii</hi>, p. 213.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
